        "content": "## 📧 Test 02 — Email\nPolls Gmail every minute for **unread** mail.\n\n1. Open *Gmail Trigger* → connect your Gmail credential (OAuth).\n2. Optional: set *Search* to `to:you@example.com` and send test mails to that plus-address so only project mail is picked up.\n3. Keep **Simplify OFF** — the normalizer needs the full body.\n4. Click *Fetch Test Event* after sending yourself a test email.",
